 "contract": "C4, C5 and C10 of docs/protocol.md: the receiver's part of PageFetch (board ab-v16.102; agent-browser's PageFetch design, sections 5.3 and 5.4). The fetch window (C10 windows.create with the mark fetch, for a scope that may have no list), the fetch window's rules (C5: rule 78 and the blocks of the refused addresses, 79 to 86), fetch_end (C4) and the hello's feature fetch. refused and allowed: the URLs that the blocks refuse and let pass, measured in Chromium 156's own DNR engine (C5). Every value is a sample.",
